      {
        "Id": "f753e684f7bf407a9dbe574dd6c6d58b",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE  -  link the CAD on its level (Insert > Link CAD), Run\nEvery pair of parallel CAD lines 75-450 mm apart becomes a wall on its centre line, thickness from the CAD (snapped to standard sizes).\nDoor / window gaps are bridged, L and T corners joined, height up to the level above.  Types A_WAL_BRICK_230 ...  Material: one name or per thickness.\nRun again any time: walls are updated in place (their doors stay), walls you made yourself are never touched.",
        "DescriptionText": null,
        "IsExpanded": true,
        "WidthAdjustment": 0.0,
        "HeightAdjustment": 0.0,
